WEBVTT

02:05:22.334 --> 02:05:24.167
I kept you away
for so long because of it.

02:05:24.334 --> 02:05:26.334
But this will never
happen again. I promise.

02:05:26.542 --> 02:05:28.792
If he went to such lengths
to save you, why did he hide?

02:05:31.125 --> 02:05:32.209
For me…

02:05:33.459 --> 02:05:35.334
what's more important than
living with my brother…
